Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns & potential usage  
• GEOGRAPHY_INDEX."GEO_ID", "GEO_NAME": locate the Phoenix‑Mesa‑Scottsdale, AZ metro GEO_ID.  
• FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES  
  – "GEO_ID": filter to the Phoenix metro GEO_ID.  
  – "DATE": filter to 2023‑01‑01 & 2023‑12‑31 period ends.  
  – "VARIABLE": choose seasonally‑adjusted, purchase‑only house‑price index.  
  – "VALUE": price‑index values used in %‑change calc.  
• FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_ATTRIBUTES  
  – "VARIABLE", "VARIABLE_NAME": find exact variable code for “purchase‑only” & “SA”.  
• IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES  
  – "GEO_ID": same Phoenix metro GEO_ID.  
  – "DATE": 2023‑12‑31 (year‑end row for 2023 inflow).  
  – "VARIABLE": locate the “Inflow … adjusted gross income … All AGI classes” series.  
  – "VALUE": gross‑income‑inflow amounts.  
• IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_ATTRIBUTES  
  – "VARIABLE", "VARIABLE_NAME": discover correct inflow variable codes (USD, All AGI classes).  

Typical filter conditions  
• GEOGRAPHY_INDEX."GEO_NAME" ILIKE '%Phoenix%Mesa%Scottsdale%'  
• FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_ATTRIBUTES."VARIABLE" ILIKE '%purchase-only%SA%'  
• IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_ATTRIBUTES."VARIABLE" ILIKE '%Inflow%adjusted%gross%income%All%AGI%'  
• FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES."DATE" BETWEEN '2023‑01‑01' AND '2023‑12‑31'  
• IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES."DATE" = '2023‑12‑31'  

Below are ten exploratory → analytic Snowflake SQL snippets (each limited to 20 rows) that move from simple discovery to a final query yielding the two requested %‑changes.  
All identifiers are enclosed in double quotes.

```sql
-- 1) Find the GEO_ID for the Phoenix‑Mesa‑Scottsdale, AZ Metro Area
SELECT "GEO_ID", "GEO_NAME"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.GEOGRAPHY_INDEX
WHERE "GEO_NAME" ILIKE '%Phoenix%Mesa%Scottsdale%' 
  AND "LEVEL" = 'MetropolitanStatisticalArea'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) List all seasonally‑adjusted purchase‑only HPI variable codes
SELECT DISTINCT "VARIABLE", "VARIABLE_NAME"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_ATTRIBUTES
WHERE "VARIABLE" ILIKE '%purchase-only%' 
  AND "SEASONALLY_ADJUSTED" = TRUE
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Preview Phoenix HPI values during 2023
SELECT "DATE", "VALUE", "UNIT"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES
WHERE "GEO_ID" = 'geoId/C38060'           -- replace with value from query #1
  AND "VARIABLE" = 'FHFA_HPI_traditional_purchase-only_monthly_SA' -- from #2
  AND "DATE" BETWEEN '2023-01-01' AND '2023-12-31'
ORDER BY "DATE"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Check first & last HPI observations in 2023
SELECT FIRST_VALUE("VALUE") 
          OVER(ORDER BY "DATE")  AS "VALUE_2023_01",
       LAST_VALUE("VALUE") 
          OVER(ORDER BY "DATE" ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING) 
                                         AS "VALUE_2023_12",
       "DATE"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES
WHERE "GEO_ID" = 'geoId/C38060'
  AND "VARIABLE" = 'FHFA_HPI_traditional_purchase-only_monthly_SA'
  AND "DATE" BETWEEN '2023-01-01' AND '2023-12-31'
ORDER BY "DATE"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Discover gross‑income inflow variable codes (USD, All AGI classes)
SELECT DISTINCT "VARIABLE", "VARIABLE_NAME"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_ATTRIBUTES
WHERE "VARIABLE" ILIKE '%Inflow%adjusted%gross%income%'
  AND "UNIT" = 'USD'
  AND "INCOME_BRACKET" = 'All AGI classes'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Preview Phoenix gross‑income inflow values for the latest years
SELECT "DATE", "VALUE", "UNIT"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES
WHERE "GEO_ID" = 'geoId/C38060'
  AND "VARIABLE" = 'Inflow_Returns_–_adjusted_gross_income_from_Year_2,_All_AGI_classes' -- example; adjust if #5 shows different
ORDER BY "DATE" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Retrieve 2022 & 2023 inflow totals (to compute 2023 change)
SELECT "DATE", "VALUE"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES
WHERE "GEO_ID"  = 'geoId/C38060'
  AND "VARIABLE" = 'Inflow_Returns_–_adjusted_gross_income_from_Year_2,_All_AGI_classes'
  AND "DATE" IN ('2022-12-31', '2023-12-31')
ORDER BY "DATE"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Calculate % change in gross‑income inflow 2023 vs 2022
SELECT 100 * (MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END) -
              MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2022-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END))
            / NULLIF(MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2022-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END),0)
        AS "PCT_CHG_GROSS_INCOME_INFLOW_2023"
FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES
WHERE "GEO_ID"  = 'geoId/C38060'
  AND "VARIABLE" = 'Inflow_Returns_–_adjusted_gross_income_from_Year_2,_All_AGI_classes'
  AND "DATE" IN ('2022-12-31','2023-12-31');
```

```sql
-- 9) Calculate % change in purchase‑only SA HPI between Jan & Dec 2023
WITH hpi AS (
  SELECT "DATE", "VALUE"
  FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES
  WHERE "GEO_ID" = 'geoId/C38060'
    AND "VARIABLE" = 'FHFA_HPI_traditional_purchase-only_monthly_SA'
    AND "DATE" IN ('2023-01-31','2023-12-31')
)
SELECT 100 * (MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END) -
              MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-01-31' THEN "VALUE" END))
            / NULLIF(MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-01-31' THEN "VALUE" END),0)
        AS "PCT_CHG_HPI_PURCHASE_ONLY_SA_2023"
FROM hpi
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Single query returning both %‑changes side‑by‑side
WITH gross AS (
  SELECT 100 * (MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END) -
                MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2022-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END))
              / NULLIF(MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2022-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END),0)
          AS "GROSS_INCOME_INFLOW_PCT_CHG_2023"
  FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.IRS_MIGRATION_BY_CHARACTERISTIC_TIMESERIES
  WHERE "GEO_ID"  = 'geoId/C38060'
    AND "VARIABLE" = 'Inflow_Returns_–_adjusted_gross_income_from_Year_2,_All_AGI_classes'
    AND "DATE" IN ('2022-12-31','2023-12-31')
),
hpi AS (
  SELECT 100 * (MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-12-31' THEN "VALUE" END) -
                MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-01-31' THEN "VALUE" END))
              / NULLIF(MAX(CASE WHEN "DATE"='2023-01-31' THEN "VALUE" END),0)
          AS "HPI_PURCHASE_ONLY_SA_PCT_CHG_2023"
  FROM US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.FHFA_HOUSE_PRICE_TIMESERIES
  WHERE "GEO_ID" = 'geoId/C38060'
    AND "VARIABLE" = 'FHFA_HPI_traditional_purchase-only_monthly_SA'
    AND "DATE" IN ('2023-01-31','2023-12-31')
)
SELECT *
FROM gross, hpi
LIMIT 20;
```

Run the queries in order, substituting the exact "GEO_ID" and "VARIABLE" strings surfaced by discovery steps #1, #2, and #5.
